      "blocks": {
        "question_giLkXQ": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How hot does The Sauna Pod get and how fast does it heat up?",
            "answer": "<p>The Sauna Pod reaches temperatures up to 85°C (185°F) in about 15 to 20 minutes using its high-output 1500W dry-air heating unit. Unlike steam units, it delivers dry, intense heat that stays consistently hot even when set up in cooler basements or garages during Canadian winters.</p>",
            "question_color": "",
            "question_font_size_desktop": 16,
            "question_font_size_mobile": 15,
            "question_font_weight": "500",
            "answer_color": "",
            "answer_font_size_desktop": 15,
            "answer_font_size_mobile": 14,
            "answer_font_weight": "400"
          }
        },
        "question_36wNwy": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Does it run on a standard Canadian wall outlet?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, absolutely. The 1500W heating unit plugs directly into any standard Canadian 110V/120V household wall outlet. No dedicated 240V wiring or expensive electrician visits are needed.</p>",
            "question_color": "",
            "question_font_size_desktop": 16,
            "question_font_size_mobile": 15,
            "question_font_weight": "500",
            "answer_color": "",
            "answer_font_size_desktop": 15,
            "answer_font_size_mobile": 14,
            "answer_font_weight": "400"
          }
        },
        "question_e4hhdC": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What materials is it made of, and is there any plastic smell?",
            "answer": "<p>The Sauna Pod is crafted with 100% natural, unbleached double-layer cotton canvas and food-grade TPU windows. Because it uses non-toxic, heat-stable materials, there is zero toxic off-gassing, harsh fumes, or melted plastic smells when running at full heat.</p>",
            "question_color": "",
            "question_font_size_desktop": 16,
            "question_font_size_mobile": 15,
            "question_font_weight": "500",
            "answer_color": "",
            "answer_font_size_desktop": 15,
            "answer_font_size_mobile": 14,
            "answer_font_weight": "400"
          }
        },
        "question_HKe6yp": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is the Ice Pod really 100% free with this bundle?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes! When you order The Sauna Pod, you receive The Standard Ice Pod plus the all-weather insulated thermal cover completely free of charge (over $400 CAD in added retail value), giving you a full at-home contrast therapy station right out of the box.</p>",
            "question_color": "",
            "question_font_size_desktop": 16,
            "question_font_size_mobile": 15,
            "question_font_weight": "500",
            "answer_color": "",
            "answer_font_size_desktop": 15,
            "answer_font_size_mobile": 14,
            "answer_font_weight": "400"
          }
        },
        "question_V76RRe": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How does shipping and the 30-day home trial work across Canada?",
            "answer": "<p>We ship nationwide with fast 2–5 business day delivery, and all orders are guaranteed 100% free of surprise customs or duty fees. You also get a 30-day risk-free trial: use both the sauna and the cold plunge at home for a month, and if you are not satisfied, return it for a refund.</p>",
